13
01:07:53,333 --> 01:07:59,333
Shoot Out is a 1971 American Western film directed by
Henry Hathaway and starring Gregory Peck.

14
01:13:06,666 --> 01:13:12,666
The film is adapted from Will James's 1930 novel, The Lone Cowboy.

15
01:18:20,000 --> 01:18:26,000
The film was produced, directed, and written by the team that
delivered the Oscar-winning film True Grit.

16
01:23:33,333 --> 01:23:39,333
This was the second-to-last of the 65 films directed by Hathaway.

